This repository (AnarchyV2) is a derivative work that adapts the original
source to Discord's API v10:
  - message embeds serialized as the "embeds" array (singular "embed" removed in v10)
  - moderation reasons sent via the X-Audit-Log-Reason header (query param removed in v10)
  - active-threads fetched from the /guilds/{guild.id}/threads/active route (channel route removed in v10)
  - added the MessageContent (1<<15) gateway intent
  - default API version bumped 9 -> 10

